# Production Sigstore/Cosign public key for official ModuLab modules.
# Matches the private key used to sign official releases via
# modulab-modules (cosign sign-blob --key cosign.key module.zip --bundle
# module.zip.sig). The verifier (verifier.go) embeds this file at build
# time and writes it to a temp file when verifying official module
# signatures.
